WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Last day with the sight roots.

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:05.580
Explain the difference between looking and seeing.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.280
Then the academic pairs that trip up even grown writers:

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:13.370
affect and effect, principal and principle.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.350
Then the last five words in the spyglass.
